# === commands ==

commands.sirenscommands.list = View a list of all the commands added to Siren's commands.
commands.sirenscommands.players = See a list of all players connected to the server.


# === macroCommands ==

macroCommands.sirenscommands.back = Teleports player to there previous back (runs tp back but shorter bindings).
macroCommands.sirenscommands.day = Sets the time of day in the world to 7.
macroCommands.sirenscommands.gma = Set a player to Adventure mode.
macroCommands.sirenscommands.gma.param0 = The username of a player to set into Adventure.
macroCommands.sirenscommands.gmc = Set a player to Creative mode.
macroCommands.sirenscommands.gmc.param0 = The username of a player to set into Creative.
macroCommands.sirenscommands.night = Sets the time of day (aka night) in the world to 21.
macroCommands.sirenscommands.die = Kills the player (aliases to /kill).
macroCommands.sirenscommands.top = Teleports player to highest surface (runs tp top but shorter bindings).


# === updateChecker ===

updateChecker.sirenscommands.release.message = The Siren's Commands Mod version is outdated, Siren's Commands has released v{version}.